<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
    <meta charset="utf-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
    <title>Verify Your Account - Affinity Echo</title>
    <style>
        body { font-family: 'Segoe UI', Tahoma, Geneva, Verdana, sans-serif; line-height: 1.6; color: #333; margin: 0; padding: 0; background: #f8f9fa; }
        .container { max-width: 600px; margin: 0 auto; background: white; }
        .header { background: linear-gradient(135deg, #667eea 0%, #764ba2 100%); padding: 40px; text-align: center; color: white; }
        .content { padding: 40px; }
        .footer { background: #f1f3f4; padding: 25px; text-align: center; color: #666; font-size: 14px; border-top: 1px solid #e0e0e0; }
        .otp-code { background: linear-gradient(135deg, #667eea 0%, #764ba2 100%); color: white; padding: 25px; text-align: center; font-size: 42px; font-weight: bold; letter-spacing: 15px; margin: 30px 0; border-radius: 12px; font-family: 'Courier New', monospace; text-shadow: 2px 2px 4px rgba(0,0,0,0.3); }
        .security-note { background: #fff3cd; border: 1px solid #ffeaa7; padding: 20px; border-radius: 8px; margin: 25px 0; }
        .next-steps { background: #e7f3ff; padding: 20px; border-radius: 8px; margin: 25px 0; }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="container">
        <div class="header">
            <h1 style="margin: 0; font-size: 28px;">Complete Your Registration</h1>
            <p style="margin: 10px 0 0; opacity: 0.9; font-size: 16px;">Affinity Echo - Verify Your Account</p>
        </div>
        
        <div class="content">
            <h2 style="color: #333; margin-bottom: 10px;">Welcome to Affinity Echo!</h2>
            <p>Hello <strong style="color: #667eea;"><%= username %></strong>,</p>
            <p>Thank you for joining our community! To complete your registration and start connecting with professionals who share your experiences, please use the verification code below:</p>
            
            <div class="otp-code">
                <%= otp %>
            </div>

            <p style="text-align: center; font-size: 16px; margin: 20px 0;">Enter this 6-digit code on the verification page to activate your account.</p>

            <div class="next-steps">
                <p style="margin: 0 0 10px; color: #0066cc; font-weight: 600;">What happens after verification?</p>
                <ul style="margin: 0; color: #0066cc; padding-left: 20px;">
                    <li>Complete your anonymous profile setup</li>
                    <li>Join affinity groups that match your background</li>
                    <li>Access company-specific forums</li>
                    <li>Start finding mentorship opportunities</li>
                </ul>
            </div>

            <div class="security-note">
                <p style="margin: 0 0 10px; color: #856404; font-weight: 600;">Security Information:</p>
                <ul style="margin: 0; color: #856404; padding-left: 20px;">
                    <li>This code will expire in 15 minutes</li>
                    <li>Do not share this code with anyone</li>
                    <li>Affinity Echo will never ask for this code via phone or email</li>
                    <li>If you didn't create an account, please ignore this email</li>
                </ul>
            </div>
        </div>
        
        <div class="footer">
            <p style="margin: 0 0 10px;">This verification code was sent as part of your account registration.</p>
            <p style="margin: 0; font-size: 12px;">Need help? Contact us at <a href="mailto:<%= supportEmail %>" style="color: #667eea;"><%= supportEmail %></a></p>
            <p style="margin: 15px 0 0; font-size: 12px;">&copy; 2024 Affinity Echo. Building stronger professionals together.</p>
        </div>
    </div>
</body>
</html>